    "whoUses": "Neurologists and neurogeneticists use this code when diagnosing and managing patients with adult-onset cerebellar degeneration, often in specialized clinics focused on movement disorders or hereditary neurological conditions. This code commonly appears on patient EOBs when billing for neurology office visits, genetic testing, imaging studies like MRI, or rehabilitation therapies related to ataxia management.",
