    "whoUses": "Neurologists and MS specialists use this code to track disease progression and treatment response in patients with established multiple sclerosis. This code commonly appears on EOB statements for patients receiving MS-modifying therapies, imaging studies, or specialist consultations related to their worsening MS symptoms.",
