    "whoUses": "Neurologists and MS specialists use this code when documenting patients in the secondary progressive phase of multiple sclerosis who are not currently having active disease activity. This code commonly appears on EOB statements for patients with established MS who are receiving disease-modifying therapy or undergoing monitoring for progression.",
