    "plainEnglish": "This is a rare and serious brain condition where the protective covering of nerve fibers in the brain becomes suddenly inflamed and bleeds, usually triggered by a viral infection or vaccination. Patients typically experience rapid symptoms like high fever, severe headache, confusion, weakness, and sometimes seizures or loss of consciousness. The condition is life-threatening and requires immediate hospital care, though some patients can recover with aggressive treatment.",
