    "whoUses": "Neurologists and neuroradiologists typically diagnose and code this condition, often identified through MRI imaging when investigating demyelinating diseases or multiple sclerosis-related complications. This code appears less frequently on patient EOBs than more common diagnoses, but may be included when billing for specialized neuroimaging studies, consultations, or treatments related to demyelinating diseases.",
