    "whoUses": "Neurologists and epilepsy specialists use this code to document juvenile myoclonic epilepsy cases, particularly when status epilepticus is occurring. This code typically appears on hospital bills and emergency department EOBs rather than routine outpatient visits, given that status epilepticus requires acute care management.",
