    "whoUses": "Neurologists, primary care physicians, pain management specialists, and headache clinics use this code when patients report persistent tension headaches that resist standard over-the-counter or first-line medications. It commonly appears on EOB statements for patients seeking specialist evaluation or receiving preventive headache treatments like botox injections or prescribed preventive medications.",
