    "whoUses": "Sleep medicine specialists, primary care physicians, and neurologists use this code when patients report sleep complaints that need documentation but don't meet criteria for more specific sleep disorders. It appears moderately often on EOBs for patients undergoing sleep studies or reporting sleep-related concerns to their healthcare provider.",
