    "whoUses": "Neurologists, primary care physicians, and physical medicine & rehabilitation specialists use this code when documenting ongoing nerve-related symptoms in patients recovering from conditions like Guillain-Barré syndrome or other inflammatory nerve conditions. This code is moderately common on patient EOBs when someone is receiving rehabilitation, follow-up neurology visits, or physical therapy for residual nerve damage.",
